	(text "MCU\nRP2354A: RP2350A with 2 MiB of flash in the package (same pinout).\nWith an RP2350A, fit U5 and C19. Never fit U5 with an RP2354A: both would answer on QSPI_SS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3323eef0-e2c3-53a2-b784-d015046dc866")
	)
	(text "SOC RESET\nTP1 goes to D3's ANODE on the switch: the front pad, by the \"+\".\nThe banded end is the 3.3 V rail. R25 limits the current if the wire is misplaced."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 482.6 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54bc41c7-e2b4-5c74-8d14-660d3ddae34a")
	)
	(text "FLASH, CLOCK, BOOT, DEBUG\nU5/C19: DNP with the RP2354A. Keep the QSPI stubs to U5 short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55c86140-ed90-517d-8cab-c51eca26a364")
	)
	(text "SWITCH HEADERS (J1-J3 are male headers on the board's underside)\n100R in series on every switch-facing line; I2C pull-ups to the switch's 3.3 V.\nJ3 pin 4 (the switch's 3.3 V on T5) is left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 431.8 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7bcb8f9-cfb7-583a-8ebd-0236b1b83a55")
	)
	(text "POWER\nThe switch's 3.3 V (T3/T8 pin 4) and USB's 3.3 V are ORed by two ideal diodes,\nso neither back-feeds the other. SW_SENSE tells the firmware whether the switch is on:\nuntil it is, keep every switch-facing pin high-impedance with its input buffer off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c563e747-411d-5fa7-9582-f546e193023f")
	)
	(text "CORE REGULATOR AND DECOUPLING\nL1, C13 (CIN), C14 (COUT), R5/C16 (VREG_AVDD filter): lay out as the Pico 2 does (datasheet 6.3.8).\nC15 is the second 4.7u at DVDD pin 23. One 100n per IOVDD and DVDD pin, at the pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f7a4a95e-cc53-5b7f-b101-d610288b1137")
	)
